<title>HONG KONG: HK's new airport to get ground support maintenance.</title>
<headline>HK's new airport to get ground support maintenance.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong's Airport Authority on Friday signed an agreement with Dah Chong Hong - Dragonair Airport GSE Service Ltd (DAS) to provide ground support equipment maintenance services at the new Chek Lap Kok airport.</p>
<p>DAS, under the 10-year agreement, will maintain and repair vehicles and equipment used by air carriers and franchises such as those providing services for air cargo aircraft maintenance, into-plane fuelling and ramp handling.</p>
</text>
